1"}], "cdcost": "CD: 14   Mana Cost: 60", "desc": "Belerick increases his Movement Speed by 80% and enhances his next Basic Attack. (The Movement Speed gained will decrease in 2s.)\nThis enhanced Basic Attack deals 300<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+60% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and slows the target by 60% for 1.4s. Belerick also recovers HP equal to 240 plus 10% of his lost HP.\nEach time Deadly Thorns is triggered, reduce the cooldown of this skill by 1s."}, {"name": "Wrath of Dryad", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8b1501526a70c36f4c89d7ab971f9eb0.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 50   Mana Cost: 150", "desc": "Belerick conjures spreading vines around him, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+30% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in the area 4 times, taunting and slowing them for 1.5s."}], "builds": [{"lane": "ROAM", "winRate": 61.9, "pickRate": 1.42, "spell": {"name": "Revitalize", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_3377a32a4db8d4009b37cfdbe29ed586.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "Tank", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_9854de7cfbb30c9fb0002521a274be4c.png", "attrs": ["+500 Extra Max HP", "+10 Extra Physical Defense", "+10 Extra Magic Defense", "+4 HP Regen"]}, "items": [{"name": "Dominance Ice", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1b1672399a7836284effcc60aaddd7de.png"}, {"name": "Antique Cuirass", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f20c5fef57268ccb59a1b818c0b0c769.png"}, {"name": "Blade Armor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_29d321d8fe1089a93f0e3f3c5a838ebd.png"}]}, {"lane": "ROAM", "winRate": 60.7, "pickRate": 1.9